{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:57 2026-05-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:57 2026-05-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:57 2026-05-14 HKT</p><p>油麻地砵蘭街與咸美頓街交界美蘭大廈對開，今日（5月14日）晚上8時許，有懷疑瓷器從高處墮地，一名途經女子躲避不及，被碎片割傷小腿，血如泉湧。救護員接報趕至時，女子仍有意識，被送往廣華醫院救治。</p><p>現場消息指，受傷女子持雙程證；事後地面殘留瓷器碎片和大灘鮮血，有警員登上附近大廈調查案件。</p><img alt=\"現場地面事後殘留大灘鮮血。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/dabceed6860ccfc41b59bf1e23cbcf2b/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_210455815_01_1_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場地面事後殘留大灘鮮血。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/775420025625c8df95f66ea61ced4900/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_210455815_02_1_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"地面殘留瓷器碎片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/4e4df7d7ea68ed7fb37a2e827e1242b4/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_210455815_05.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/dd313fd098a6cefbcf4b105b5226fcb8/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_210455815_09.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警員登上美蘭大廈調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/5d956a26da80947cf9dc8bc3792adead/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_210455815_13.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警員登上美蘭大廈調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/a3ad2441c4adc19466af910c2edc2d58/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260514_210455815_12.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-14T14:27:25.634859+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}